{
  "name": "Shuffll Engage - Discover video templates",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "102528fc-5d05-4548-aa08-9889c2e74203",
      "name": "Setup and limitations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Discover your video templates\n\nConfigure a private **Templated Custom Auth** credential on every HTTP node. Template: `{\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer {{api_key}}\"}}`. Store your workspace-scoped key only in the credential secret field. A paid Shuffll subscription and enabled API access are required.\n\nRead-only. Inspect capabilities before using downstream operations. Lists the first 50 templates; a non-null `nextCursor` means there are more. Add a `cursor` query parameter with that exact value and rerun the list node to continue. Template presence does not establish render readiness. Inspect the selected published version before creating a campaign.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a775a22-655d-4596-8abd-521ad952c7ca",
